            <details class="group bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 p-4 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>Q: 提示“优惠码无效”或“无法使用此优惠券”是什么原因？</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
